              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_2 x)^{2}+36\\log_{(2)} x+45\\lt 18\\log_2^{2} x\"></span>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T17:24:18.055584+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\frac{1}{8};\\frac{1}{2})\\cup (8;32)\"></span> . </p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T17:24:18.055584+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Пе­ре­не­сем вы­ра­же­ние из пра­вой части в левую и сгруп­пи­ру­ем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_2 x)^{2}+36\\log_{(2)} x+45\\lt 18\\log_2^{2} x\\iff (\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_2 x)^{2}-18(\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x)+45\\lt 0\"></span>.</span></p></center><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x\"></span>, тогда: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-18t+45\\lt 0\\iff (t-3)(t-15)\\lt 0\\iff 3\\lt t\\lt 15\"></span>. </p></center><p>Вер­нем­ся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x\\gt 3\\\\\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x\\lt 15\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_2 x-3\\gt 0\\\\\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_2 x-15\\lt 0\\end{cases}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\log_2 x\"></span>, тогда:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}y^{2}-2y-3\\gt 0\\\\y^{2}-2y-15\\lt 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}y\\lt -1\\\\y\\gt 3\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\-3\\lt y\\lt 5\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-3\\lt y\\lt -1\\\\3\\lt y\\lt 5\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Вер­нем­ся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}-3\\lt \\log_2 x\\lt -1\\\\3\\lt \\log_2 x\\lt 5\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\underset{2\\gt 1}{\\iff}\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{8}\\lt x\\lt \\frac{1}{2}\\\\8\\lt x\\lt 32\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p><b>При­ме­ча­ние.</b></p><p>Из не­ра­вен­ства  <span data-inline-latex=\"(t-3)(t-15)\\lt 0\"></span> можно было бы пе­рей­ти к не­ра­вен­ству </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x-3)(\\log_2^{2} x-2\\log_{(2)} x-15)\\lt 0\"></span>,</p></center><p>от­ку­да имеем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\log_2 x-5)(\\log_2 x+3)(\\log_2 x-3)(\\log_2 x+1)\\lt 0\"></span>. </p></center><p>Изоб­ра­зим ре­ше­ния по­лу­чен­но­го не­ра­вен­ство от­но­си­тель­но ло­га­риф­ма:</p><center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"49728f1c-ccc5-4c0d-af76-8363791b4c66\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p></center><p> Далее как ранее.</p>",
              "title": "Решение",
